pdx.org/licenses/","rights":"MIT License","rightsIdentifier":"mit"}],"descriptions":[{"descriptionType":"Abstract","description":"Code, derived data (parsed final answers as letters, numbers or opaque codes, 0/1 correctness, token counts and costs) and tests that recompute the tables of the paper \"Generative operators in language-model ensembles: what they add to their starting point and what they cost\" (paper 2 of a series on language-model ensembles) from the stored data, offline and without model calls: self-consistency, sources of diversity, debate, synthesis and decomposition, measured against their starting point and compared at an equal budget in dollars; an exploratory set A and a preregistered confirmatory set B.\n\nCode under MIT; per-source terms for the data in LICENSE-DATA.md. GPQA Diamond and HLE: item identifiers and answer letters or opaque codes only. Repository: https://github.com/Alatip/paper-2 (tag v1.0.0)."}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"url":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23756146","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":0,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"api","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":0,"downloadCount":0,"referenceCount":0,"citationCount":0,"partCount":0,"partOfCount":0,"versionCount":0,"versionOfCount":0,"created":"2026-10-29T08:27:50Z","registered":"2026-10-29T08:27:50Z","published":null,"updated":"2026-10-29T08:27:50Z"},"relationships":{"client":{"data":{"id":"cern.zenodo","type":"clients"}}}}],"meta":{"total":15129,"totalPages":10000,"page":1},"links":{"self":"https://api.datacite.org/dois?query=titles.title%3A%22language+model%22\u0026page%5Bsize%5D=1","next":"https://api.datacite.org/dois?page%5Bnumber%5D=2\u0026page%5Bsize%5D=1\u0026query=titles.title%3A%22language+model%22"}}